{
  "schema": "htdt.capture.bundle.source-ref-vectors",
  "version": "1",
  "description": "Shared Capture Bundle v1 source_refs and reserved-path vectors. Grammar: each ref is 'path:'+declared relative path (never the entry's own path, never undeclared, acyclic across entries), 'sha256:'+64 lowercase hex resolving to a declared payload digest (never the entry's own digest), 'capture_session:'+canonical UUIDv4 member of capture_session_ids, or the exact sentinel 'roomplan_raw_serialization:unavailable'. Empty, duplicated, or otherwise-shaped refs fail. Entries with role=derived require at least one ref. Reserved canonical paths bind exact media_type/producer/provenance_class/role; the device/user provenance classes (arkit_frame_observation, arkit_scene_depth_observation, arkit_mesh_reconstruction, apple_roomplan_raw_scan, apple_roomplan_inference, user_attested_measurement, user_annotation) are only valid on their bound paths. roomplan/captured-room.json additionally requires a sha256: ref to the declared roomplan/captured-room-data.json digest.",
